cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Marcadores de Paula in research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: Marcadores de Paula
abstract: >-
  Desktop application for preparing research transcripts: media collection
  with yt-dlp, local WhisperX transcription with word alignment and pyannote
  speaker diarization, audio-linked transcript review, discourse annotation
  with a project codebook, and export to TXT, DOCX, CSV, JSON, SRT, VTT,
  Praat TextGrid and ELAN EAF.
authors:
